# Parallel and Perpendicular on an empty sketch: three slanted segments.
# Parallel, tool first, on L1 then L2, which point the same way:
# parallel(L1, L2, 1). Perpendicular on the selection of L1 and L3, L3
# turning right of L1 as drawn: perpendicular(L1, L3, -1).
open tests/data/sketch-blank.json
wait 16
action tool.segment
wait 2
click L 415 503
click L 743 449
click L 415 339
click L 689 273
click L 634 120
click L 667 229
key Escape
key Escape
wait 2
action tool.parallel
wait 2
click L 661 462
click L 620 290
wait 2
key Escape
wait 2
select element L1 element L3
action tool.perpendicular
wait 4
